<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταποι-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>alter the make of</i> a thing, <i>remodel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.121
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα ἐς τοὺς τρόπους τοὺς
					παραπλησίους μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς γάμον ἀπὸ τῆς θυσίας μ. τὴν
					εὐωχίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				36
			</span></i>: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταποίησον</span>
			<i>re-compose</i> the verse, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				20.3
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖσθαι εἰς τὸ δέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					199.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>lay claim to, pretend to</i>, c. gen. rei, e.g.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνέσεως, ἀρετῆς τι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.140
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.51
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					289e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέν σφι μετεὸν
			μεταποιεῦνται</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ
			ἐμπορίου</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.178
			</span></i>.</div>
